invariant: INV-75
file: proof/run.sh
catches: test/prove-status-check.sh
reason: the report loop takes wait's answer and ignores the status each
  job wrote. Once a new child of run.sh takes a job's process id, wait
  answers 127, which fails a harness that verified, or the new child's
  0, which passes a cbmc that died after it printed its verdict. The
  check runs the report loop with wait answering 127 and then 0.

--- old
    *) rc=$job_rc ;;
--- new
    *) ;;
